# Copy to .env for local dev: `copy .env.example .env` (Windows) or `cp .env.example .env`.
# Never commit .env itself (see .gitignore + docs/security.md).
# This file documents *which* variables are needed, with placeholder/dummy values only.

# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=

# Read by generation/rephraser.py's ClaudeRephraser at call time only — never written to disk,
# the database, or a generated artifact (spec criterion 23, docs/security.md).
#
# Loaded automatically from .env by web/__main__.py's main() (via python-dotenv) at startup —
# no more exporting it by hand every session. Fill it in below, in your own gitignored .env,
# never here.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
